---
// Quiz figure for go-slices-maps-strings set 02: the headers of a nil slice and an empty non-nil slice.
// It shows the three header words of each; it does not show how any library encodes them.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq03ne">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 230" role="img" aria-label="Two slice headers, each with ptr, len and cap. The first has ptr nil, len 0 and cap 0. The second has ptr set to an address, len 0 and cap 0.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq03ne-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two slice headers with len 0</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai slice header đều có len 0</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="52" class="qfig-gq03ne-t">var s []string</text>
    <rect x="20" y="64" width="250" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq03ne-cell" />
    <line x1="103" x2="103" y1="64" y2="108" class="qfig-gq03ne-sep" />
    <line x1="187" x2="187" y1="64" y2="108" class="qfig-gq03ne-sep" />
    <text x="61" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-w">ptr</text>
    <text x="61" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-m">nil</text>
    <text x="145" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-w">len</text>
    <text x="145" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-m">0</text>
    <text x="229" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-w">cap</text>
    <text x="229" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-m">0</text>

    <text x="310" y="52" class="qfig-gq03ne-t">e := []string&#123;&#125;</text>
    <rect x="310" y="64" width="250" height="44" rx="6" class="qfig-gq03ne-cell" />
    <line x1="393" x2="393" y1="64" y2="108" class="qfig-gq03ne-sep" />
    <line x1="477" x2="477" y1="64" y2="108" class="qfig-gq03ne-sep" />
    <text x="351" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-w">ptr</text>
    <text x="351" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-m">address</text>
    <text x="435" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-w">len</text>
    <text x="435" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-m">0</text>
    <text x="519" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-w">cap</text>
    <text x="519" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq03ne-m">0</text>

    <rect x="20" y="136" width="540" height="76" rx="8" class="qfig-gq03ne-card" />
    <text x="36" y="160" class="qfig-gq03ne-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>ptr: where the first item would be stored</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ptr: nơi lưu phần tử đầu tiên</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="184" class="qfig-gq03ne-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>len and cap: how many items, and how much room</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>len và cap: số phần tử, và số chỗ có sẵn</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq03ne { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq03ne svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq03ne text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq03ne .qfig-gq03ne-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq03ne .qfig-gq03ne-t { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq03ne .qfig-gq03ne-w { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq03ne .qfig-gq03ne-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq03ne .qfig-gq03ne-b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq03ne-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq03ne-sep { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq03ne-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
</style>
